      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "+1 striking shifting falcata",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Though unable to move on their own, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " can flex, adjust their center of mass, and make other adjustments to adapt to a chosen wielder's fighting style. For the purposes of proficiency, class abilities, and feats (except those that would increase the weapon's damage die size), a wielder that "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " approves of can treat "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " as a martial weapon that belongs to their choice of the axe, brawling, club, knife, pick, spear, or sword weapon group. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " does not actually change form and their critical specialization effect does not change. As a hero-god, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a mythic being who starts each session with their own pool of 3 Mythic Points. Whenever their wielder would regain 2 or more Mythic Points, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " regains 1 Mythic Point."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Forward Planning",
