          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " studies the ongoing combat and myriad ways an upcoming attack might resolve. On the next attack made using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before the end of their next turn, their wielder rolls twice and takes the better result."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Activate—Spell Reserve",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
