          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Aerekostes",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " channels their mythic power into a minor miracle. They spend 1 Mythic Point, then casts one of the following as a 3rd-rank spell (DC 24 save as appropriate): "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
